{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30559","headline":"和主司王起 · 卢肇","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵩高降德爲时生，洪笔三题造化名。\n凤诏伫归专北极，骊珠搜得尽东瀛。\n褒衣已换金章贵，禁掖曾随玉树荣。\n明日定知同相印，青衿新列柳间营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}